// Outlook Initiating Outbound SMB/WebDAV to External Host (CVE-2023-23397 pattern) | T1187 | Hub
(process.executable.caseless:*\\OUTLOOK.EXE AND (destination.port:(445 OR 139))) AND (NOT (destination.ip:10.0.0.0\/8 OR destination.ip:172.16.0.0\/12 OR destination.ip:192.168.0.0\/16 OR destination.ip:127.0.0.0\/8))
